#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:5 c666f5118b024180a25f5ff83db6630b
msgid "Flip Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:9 86d78dd7a1944c4cac8cac0bb4b9b12b
msgid ""
"Vehicle will flip on its roll or pitch axis depending upon the pilot's "
"roll and pitch stick position. Vehicle will rise for 1 second and then "
"rapidly flip. The vehicle will not flip again until the switch is brought"
" low and back to high. Give yourself at least 10m of altitude before "
"trying flip for the first time!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:14 590ac38cefd54ed8a8d74ca604d3ebd2
msgid "Flip Mode State Machine"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:17 70d185e7496a4f1cbd5cfa5e8126f6d5
msgid "Controls:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:19 50ff57b25dc8415589f9356c557bee36
msgid "An ``RCx_OPTION`` parameter must be set to \"Flip\" which is \"2\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:20 77f7e283df224abc9eefd474249ee736
msgid ""
"Pilot switches to Stabilize, Acro or AltHold flight mode and puts ch7/ch8"
" switch to ON position"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:21 c55fed4a0efa488c91b23ca92cf94589
msgid ""
"Vehicle will Roll right by default but if roll or pitch stick is held "
"slightly left, forward or back it will flip in that direction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:22 709e106edafc4a179309ab845b293734
msgid ""
"Vehicle should complete the roll within 2.5sec and will then return to "
"the original flight mode it was in before flip was triggered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:23 c87512bcbb314f41ad7abdd469c1e01d
msgid ""
"Pilot may manually exit flip by switching off ch7/ch8 or by moving roll "
"stick to >40deg left or right"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:26 104552ba26bd4cb0afc7e682c1d04e15
msgid "State machine approach:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:28 fd1a05330f1c426da83fd71dab396abd
msgid ""
"Flip_Start (while copter is leaning <45deg) : roll right at 400deg/sec, "
"increase throttle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:29 2321736b415f47e1bdd2ff2f4864f252
msgid ""
"Flip_Roll (while copter is between +45deg ~ -90) : roll right at "
"400deg/sec, reduce throttle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:30 221da4d0f7f843a89a95e51a521407bf
msgid ""
"Flip_Recover (while copter is between -90deg and original target angle) :"
" use earth frame angle controller to return vehicle to original attitude"
msgstr ""

